parrot-tools-alchemy (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=low

  * Resolve symlinks relative to final directory.
  * USE_BUILD_DEPS_CHECK_IN_CONFIG is now enabled by default.
  * Add BUILD_META_PACKAGE.
  * Do not fail config check if commented lines are added/removed.
  * Allow override of CFLAGS/C_INCLUDES of autotools.
  * Add LOCAL_INSTALL_HEADERS.
  * Add LOCAL_CREATE_LINKS.
  * Add LOCAL_REQUIRED_MODULES.
  * Only do some checks if modules are built.
  * Make sure no atom.mk tries to modify a TARGET_XXX variable

 -- Yves-Marie Morgan (Parrot) <yves-marie.morgan@parrot.com>  Thu, 04 Apr 2013 11:46:55 +0200

parrot-tools-alchemy (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=low

  * Make sure everything is working if 'all' is given with another goal.
  * Get correct sysroot based on cflags.
  * When reactivating a module, keep its saved config.
  * Add 'category path' feature.
  * Use CXXFLAGS instead of CPPFLAGS.
  * Update arm setup.
  * Display warning when the same atom.mk is found several times.

 -- Yves-Marie Morgan (Parrot) <yves-marie.morgan@parrot.com>  Tue, 19 Feb 2013 14:59:15 +0100

